{"id": "62925", "title": "媚杀", "author": "疏影簪（湿手摸电门）", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 32, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/62/62925.htm", "intro": "哪有一段情不是刻骨铭心？\r\n\r\n弃命山庄收养的小孤女叶朵澜，被苦心栽培成江湖上的女杀手，却无意间搅乱汲家三兄弟的心\r\n\r\n一次下山铲除对手的行动中，她竟与三年前一次任务中的“主角”第五鹤再次相遇\r\n\r\n温柔的小道士不嗔，原来竟来自于西域魔教，杀了他，还是爱上他？\r\n\r\n古风处女作：女杀手的江湖情事\r\n\r\n主角关键字 —— 叶朵澜（古代）", "base": "files/article/html/62/62925", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部分", "file": "9330730.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部分", "file": "9330731.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三部分", "file": "9330732.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四部分", "file": "9330733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五部分", "file": "9330736.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六部分", "file": "9330739.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七部分", "file": "9330741.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八部分", "file": "9330744.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九部分", "file": "9330745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十部分", "file": "9330746.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11部分", "file": "9330749.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12部分", "file": "9330751.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13部分", "file": "9330757.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14部分", "file": "9330759.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15部分", "file": "9330762.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16部分", "file": "9330763.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17部分", "file": "9330765.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18部分", "file": "9330767.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19部分", "file": "9330770.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20部分", "file": "9330772.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21部分", "file": "9330773.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22部分", "file": "9330779.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23部分", "file": "9330781.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24部分", "file": "9330783.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25部分", "file": "9330784.html"